# Every text file is LF in the working tree too. With autocrlf a Windows
# checkout turned them into CRLF, and then the single-file build measured 14 KB
# larger than on CI, the legal pages were generated wrong (headings as plain
# paragraphs) and the store listing could not be parsed.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
